      },
      "cr": 1,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — General Ironhand.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. XP ledger: level 2, power rating 3 → CR 1 as a officer. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Administrator of Atrocities</strong> — Iron Legion (High-ranking general)</p><p>Status: Active — high-ranking Iron Legion general</p><p>General Ironhand is the commander of the Iron Legion and the person responsible for Order 120—the execution of all Toad prisoners in Legion custody. He is not a ranting warlord or a cackling villain. He is an administrator who happens to have the authority to sign orders for mass murder, and that makes him more terrifying than any dragon. Waluigi would like General Ironhand to go sit on a Thwomp. Waluigi would like this noted for the record.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Sabre</strong> — “The Administrator of Atrocities”</li><li><strong>Hidden in Plain Sight</strong> — “When Bones infiltrated Aegis Command and was caught, Ironhand handled the interrogation personally.”</li><li><strong>Sneak Attack</strong> — “He stabbed Bones with precision, making a professional point about consequences, the way someone else might send a strongly-worded memo.”</li><li><strong>Leadership</strong> — “General Ironhand is the commander of the Iron Legion and the person responsible for Order 120—the execution of all Toad prisoners in Legion custody.”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/general_ironhand</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/general_ironhand</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
